{
  "name": "living-yua",
  "description": "Install YUA plus the living-world patch on the QA profile, prove both plugins load and both YUA/Mira materialize in the Bannered Mare, then pause for dialogue and follower-ownership checks.",
  "baseline": "Save3_474D5830_0_507269736F6E6572_Tamriel_000008_20260802003106_1_1",
  "defaults": {
    "settle_seconds": 8,
    "assert_retry_seconds": 30
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "kill",
      "mo2": true,
      "label": "start from a clean Skyrim and MO2 session"
    },
    {
      "type": "install",
      "source": "/home/lorkhan/skyrim_mods/hdd/YUA Follower ESL.7z",
      "mod_name": "QA YUA Follower ESL"
    },
    {
      "type": "install",
      "source": "/home/lorkhan/skyrim_mods/mine/MFLivingYUA.zip",
      "mod_name": "QA MFLivingYUA"
    },
    {
      "type": "launch",
      "wait": 240
    },
    {
      "type": "assert_state",
      "label": "the engine loaded YUA",
      "include": [
        "plugins"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "plugins[*].name": {
          "eq": "YUA_Follower.esp"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "assert_state",
      "label": "the engine loaded the living-world patch",
      "include": [
        "plugins"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "plugins[*].name": {
          "eq": "MFLivingYUA.esp"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "load_baseline"
    },
    {
      "type": "console",
      "cmd": "coc WhiterunBanneredMare",
      "settle": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "assert_state",
      "label": "YUA materialized in the Bannered Mare",
      "include": [
        "nearby_actors"
      ],
      "radius": 4096,
      "expect": {
        "player.cell_form_id": {
          "eq": 90206
        },
        "player.interior": true,
        "nearby_actors[*].name": {
          "eq": "YUA"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "assert_state",
      "label": "Mira is present as the rumor speaker",
      "include": [
        "nearby_actors"
      ],
      "radius": 4096,
      "expect": {
        "nearby_actors[*].name": {
          "eq": "Mira Snow-Voice"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "console",
      "cmd": "set MFLiving_N0_Deeds to 3",
      "settle": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "handoff_user",
      "message": "請在遊戲內驗收 YUA：1) 確認只有一個 YUA，Mira 也在酒館；2) 問 Mira『Any word of YUA?』；3) 對 YUA 各做一次 fund/praise，console `getglobalvalue MFLiving_N0_Favor` 應為 2；4) 記下 deeds，招募 YUA，等 10 秒並切一次 cell/過至少 2 遊戲時，她不能被拉走且 deeds 不增加；5) dismiss 後回 Bannered Mare 等 6 秒，她應重新被 living controller 納管。完成直接按 Enter；任何異常請輸入一句現象再按 Enter。",
      "expect": "one YUA; rumor and fund/praise work; teammate ownership is respected; dismissal resumes living-world control"
    }
  ],
  "teardown": [
    {
      "type": "kill",
      "mo2": true
    },
    {
      "type": "uninstall",
      "mod_name": "QA MFLivingYUA"
    },
    {
      "type": "uninstall",
      "mod_name": "QA YUA Follower ESL"
    }
  ]
}
